    "body": "Stacked on #19.\n\nBefore: The relationship-annotator doc had nowhere to put open design questions.\n\nAfter: The literate doc ends with an empty \"Design considerations\" section, ready for brainstorming. It has no code blocks, so the doc still tangles to the module byte for byte.\n\nHow: one heading and one sentence in `docs/tangles/custom/sp-relationship-annotator.org`, plus a CHANGELOG.org entry.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01YKB9W9Svzsc4PYxBD8qL9Q)_",
